flowchart LR
    Internet -->|HTTPS 443; ACM TLS| ALB[Public ALB across 2 AZs]
    ALB -->|HTTP 8080; ALB SG only| ECS[Private ECS Fargate tasks across 2 AZs]
    ECS -->|HTTPS private endpoints| ECR[ECR API and Docker]
    ECS -->|HTTPS gateway endpoint| S3[ECR image layers in S3]
    ECS -->|stdout via private endpoint| Logs[CloudWatch Logs]
    ALB --> Metrics[CloudWatch metrics and alarms]
    Metrics --> SNS[SNS on-call email]
    GitHub -->|OIDC exact repository + environment| IAM[Environment deployment role]
    IAM --> ECR
    IAM -->|Register revision and update one service| ECS
